VALUES ('42fce30d-19d5-51e6-842a-37b904cffdc3', 'binary-tree-inorder-traversal', 'Binary Tree Inorder Traversal', 'Easy', 'Trees', 'Given the `root` of a binary tree, return *the inorder traversal of its nodes'' values*.

 

