VALUES ('071cb484-d7fd-580c-89ea-f49fb274a45e', 'binary-tree-preorder-traversal', 'Binary Tree Preorder Traversal', 'Easy', 'Trees', 'Given the `root` of a binary tree, return *the preorder traversal of its nodes'' values*.

 

