VALUES ('ce6f2e00-a288-51b6-b353-7a33571710d5', 'binary-tree-right-side-view', 'Binary Tree Right Side View', 'Medium', 'Trees', 'Given the `root` of a binary tree, imagine yourself standing on the **right side** of it, return *the values of the nodes you can see ordered from top to bottom*.

 

